---
---
<section id="about" class="about page-gutter" aria-label="About ALTR">
  <div class="about__inner">
    <div class="about__col-l fade-up">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <p class="about__index mono">§ 02</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about__col-r">
      <h2 class="about__title fade-up">
        A specialty matcha cafe. Single-cultivar, carefully blended, served with precision.
      </h2>
      <div class="about__body fade-up">
        <p>
          ALTR opened with a narrow mandate — to source matcha directly from the people
          who grow it, and to serve it the way the leaf asks to be served. We don't
          chase volume. We list a small number of blends, change them with the harvest,
          and ground every tin the morning we pour it.
        </p>
        <p>
          The cupping notes on this menu are honest. The prices reflect the work in the
          field, not the work in the cafe. If you are new to matcha, we are happy to
          walk you through the menu. If you are not, you already know what to order.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: var(--space-3xl);
    border-top: var(--rule-hairline);
  }
  .about__inner {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
  }
  .about__col-l {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }
  .about__index {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }
  .about__title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.75rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    max-width: 32ch;
  }
  .about__body {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    max-width: 38rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .about__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 12rem 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-3xl);
    }
    .about__col-l {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: flex-start;
      gap: var(--space-md);
      position: sticky;
      top: calc(var(--nav-h) + var(--space-lg));
      align-self: start;
    }
  }
</style>
